    safeRemoveSymlink()
safeRemoveSymlinkSymlinks
SymlinkssafeRemoveSymlink

safeRemoveSymlink ( $path)[static]

Safely removes a symlink or directory. CRITICAL: Use with caution as it may perform recursive deletion if the path is a directory.





Parameters










string$path

The path to remove 







                Returns


bool True on success, false on failure 




